Z||000014||Pontiaddict||09-01-2001||09:30 PM||||If you wanted to do the work, it's possible. Good luck finding a good wiring harness though.||||reg||1
Z||000015||Old Lar||09-01-2001||09:45 PM||||When Fran did his 84 Indy Pace car modification, the cost of the wiring was expensive.  Most of the stuff in front the the fire wall needed to be rewired.  He had to have the AC adapted to the new harness.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fran's_pace_car_arrivingM_2.jpg"> <BR>The 84 harness wasn't expecting a V6, so the wires aren't there.  It can be done, but to do it correctly takes time $$ or both.<BR>||||reg||1
